.SH "NAME"
Docv::Theme::Paint \- A color of a spec: its base, the fixed color, and a ramp in percent (toward the foreground when positive, the background when negative).
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBstruct Docv::Theme::Paint\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
A color of a spec: its base, the fixed color, and a ramp in percent
(toward the foreground when positive, the background when negative).
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(base : Base = Base::Default, color : Color = Color::DEFAULT, ramp : Int32 = 0)\fR
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.PP
\fBdef base : Base\fR
.PP
