.PP
\fBdef ramp : Int32\fR
.TP 4
\fBdef resolve(palette : Palette, foreground : Bool) : Color\fR
The color for \fIpalette\fR, as a foreground or background. Ramped
colors are RGB; others stay palette colors of the terminal theme.
